---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Free resources" description="Everything Sébastien publishes for free: notes, concepts, newsletter, guides, tools, public events.">
  <div class="rich">
  <span class="pill">Free</span>
  <h1 class="mt-4 text-4xl font-extrabold leading-tight">Free, for <span class="gradient-word">everyone</span></h1>
  <p class="mt-3 text-lg muted">A lot of what I make costs nothing. Some of it is the theory behind the paid products, published in full. Use it alongside your path.</p>

  <div class="card mt-3"><h3 class="font-bold"><a href="https://notes.dsebastien.net">notes.dsebastien.net</a></h3><p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">My public knowledge base. 10K+ linked notes: the complete Obsidian Starter Kit user guide, all the PKM theory, the write-ups of every Knowii event, book notes, and a lot more. Use the search.</p></div>
  <div class="card mt-3"><h3 class="font-bold"><a href="https://concepts.dsebastien.net">concepts.dsebastien.net</a></h3><p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Thousands of concepts, methods and principles, each on its own page, cross-linked. When a course or workshop names something you don't know, look it up here first.</p></div>
  <div class="card mt-3"><h3 class="font-bold"><a href="https://dsebastien.net/newsletter">DeveloPassion's Newsletter</a></h3><p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">200+ editions on knowledge management, knowledge work, personal organization and zen productivity. The whole archive is free to read; subscribe to get the next one.</p></div>
  <div class="card mt-3"><h3 class="font-bold"><a href="/modules/knowledge-system-checklist">Knowledge Management System Checklist</a></h3><p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Eight phases, yes/no items. Fifteen minutes to find out where your system stands. Link in your newsletter welcome email or Gumroad purchase email; otherwise <a href="https://store.dsebastien.net/product/knowledge-system-checklist">grab it here</a>.</p></div>
  <div class="card mt-3"><h3 class="font-bold"><a href="/modules/beginners-guide-obsidian">Beginner's Guide to Mastering Obsidian</a></h3><p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Interface, links, graph, tags, plugins, templates, sync, shortcuts, mistakes. An hour. <a href="https://www.dsebastien.net/free-beginners-guide-to-mastering-obsidian/">Read it online</a>, no account needed.</p></div>
  <div class="card mt-3"><h3 class="font-bold"><a href="https://www.knowii.net/c/public-events?pastEvents=true&sort=desc&iframe=false">Public Knowii events</a></h3><p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Live rooms and public sessions, open without an account. Past ones have recordings.</p></div>
  <div class="card mt-3"><h3 class="font-bold"><a href="https://tools.dsebastien.net">tools.dsebastien.net</a></h3><p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Every tool I've built: Obsidian plugins, utilities, apps. Free and paid, listed in one place.</p></div>
  <div class="card mt-3"><h3 class="font-bold"><a href="https://www.store.dsebastien.net/product/knowii-community">Knowii Explorer</a></h3><p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed">Not free (€14.99 a quarter) but the cheapest way to have people around you while you build your system. Includes the PKM Tools Database and the community knowledge base.</p></div>

  <p class="my-3 text-white/85 leading-relaxed"><a href="/paths/free-resources">There's a path for the free resources too.</a></p>
  </div>
</Base>
